diff --git a/gcc/ChangeLog b/gcc/ChangeLog
index efcb6a0426af..05aac33e1fd9 100644
--- a/gcc/ChangeLog
+++ b/gcc/ChangeLog
@@ -1,3 +1,27 @@
+2026-11-04  Jeevitha  <jeevitha@linux.ibm.com>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2026-11-02  Jeevitha Palanisamy  <jeevitha@linux.ibm.com>
+
+	PR target/127274
+	* config/rs6000/emmintrin.h (_mm_movemask_pd): Reverse vector
+	element order on big-endian Power10 before calling vec_extractm().
+	(_mm_movemask_epi8): Likewise.
+	* config/rs6000/xmmintrin.h (_mm_movemask_ps): Likewise.
+
+2026-11-04  Siddhesh Poyarekar  <siddhesh@gotplt.org>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2026-10-19  Siddhesh Poyarekar  <siddhesh@gotplt.org>
+
+	PR tree-optimization/127899
+	* tree-object-size.cc (plus_stmt_object_size): Reset WHOLESIZE
+	if BYTES is unknown.
+	(dynamic_object_size): Return bool.
+	(cond_expr_object_size): Adjust calls and return REEXAMINE.
+	(collect_object_sizes_for): Add assert that size is unknown for
+	reexamined objects.
+
